  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LIKE lett 2022-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Making Gender Equality Work High-level Forum, 2022-2025. LIKE lett is a forum for sharing Norwegian experiences with women and working life with countries that are interested in learning more about this, but are not necessarily relevant for long-term cooperation. The forum is intended to inspire national authorities in developing countries, contribute to the exchange of experience and it can form part of the dialogue on equality Norwegian embassies have with the authorities in the respective countries.</narrative>
  </description>
